committer zichuanxu <zichuanxu28@gmail.com> 1790599143 +0900

Add E1 driver and analysis; tighten writer value format and quote matching

Smoke findings: the writer often put sentences into the typed value, and
multi-line quotes from contact cards skipped lines. The writer prompt now
states the value format per type; the checker matches quotes segment by
segment in order. E1 runs six HoldMem cells per world and branch with a
pre-intervention hash assertion, JSON arm, zero system, RAG and oracle;
the analysis computes item-paired detection and repair metrics with
world-bootstrap contrasts. World-clustered bootstrap and TOST helpers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
